<?php

namespace Database\Seeders;

use App\Models\Page;
use App\Models\Post;
use App\Models\PostCategory;
use Illuminate\Database\Seeder;
use Illuminate\Support\Str;

class ContentSeeder extends Seeder
{
    public function run(): void
    {
        foreach (['Jobs', 'Study Abroad', 'Visa Updates', 'Attestation', 'Events', 'Photos', 'Videos'] as $name) {
            PostCategory::firstOrCreate(['slug' => Str::slug($name)], ['name' => $name]);
        }
        $guides = [
            ['Study Abroad', 'Your study abroad journey starts with a clear plan', 'A practical starting point for choosing a course, organizing academic records and discussing your preferred destination.', "Start with your goals\nConsider your preferred subject, qualification level, budget and intended intake. Your academic background and language preparation help identify suitable options.\n\nPrepare your documents\nKeep clear copies of your academic certificates, transcripts and passport ready. Each institution sets its own admission requirements; our team can help organize the application checklist.\n\nPlan the next steps\nEdu World can assist with course selection, university applications, admission documentation and student visa preparation. Admission decisions remain with the institution, and visa decisions with the relevant authority.", '/apply?service=study_abroad', 'Start your study journey'],
            ['Jobs', 'Preparing your profile for overseas opportunities', 'A well-organized CV and clear employment history help our team understand your experience and preferences.', "Tell us about your experience\nInclude your current occupation, relevant skills, work history, qualifications, language skills and preferred destinations. Make sure your contact information is up to date.\n\nPrepare a clear CV\nDescribe previous roles accurately and keep relevant certificates ready. Provide personal identity documents only through our secure application process when required.\n\nUnderstand the process\nRegistration helps Edu World assess your profile against available employer requirements. This guidance is not a vacancy announcement. Registration does not guarantee employment; selection, work permits and employment conditions depend on employers and relevant authorities.", '/apply?service=job_assistance', 'Register your profile'],
            ['Visa Updates', 'Getting your travel documents organized', 'Understand the information our team needs to help prepare your visa and travel documentation.', "Begin with your travel plan\nTell us your destination, purpose of travel, proposed dates, nationality and current country of residence. Requirements vary by destination and applicant circumstances.\n\nBuild an application checklist\nOur team can assist with application forms, supporting document organization, cover letters, itineraries and appointment guidance. Confirm the current requirements with the relevant embassy, consulate or authorized processing body before submission.\n\nKeep decisions in perspective\nEdu World provides application and documentation assistance. Visa approval or refusal is determined solely by the responsible authority. No visa approval can be guaranteed. This article is general preparation guidance, not an announcement of a change in visa rules.", '/apply?service=visa_services', 'Request visa assistance'],
        ];
        foreach ($guides as [$category, $title, $excerpt, $body, $url, $label]) {
            Post::firstOrCreate(['slug' => Str::slug($title)], [
                'category_id' => PostCategory::where('slug', Str::slug($category))->value('id'),
                'title' => $title, 'excerpt' => $excerpt, 'body' => $body,
                'author_name' => 'Edu World', 'is_published' => true, 'is_featured' => false,
                'published_at' => now(), 'cta_url' => $url, 'cta_label' => $label,
                'seo_title' => Str::limit($title, 70, ''), 'meta_description' => Str::limit($excerpt, 170, ''),
            ]);
        }
        $pages = [
            'privacy-policy' => ['Privacy Policy', "About this policy\nEdu World collects the information you provide when you contact us, submit an application or request a service. This may include your name, contact details, nationality, service preferences, relevant application information and documents you choose to upload.\n\nHow we use your information\nWe use this information to respond to your enquiry, review your requirements, communicate with you, coordinate the requested service and maintain application and payment records. Where needed for that service, relevant information may be shared with institutions, employers, authorized service providers or authorities involved in your application. Ask our team about the recipients relevant to your case.\n\nDocuments and payment information\nApplication documents are kept in protected storage and accessed by authorized team members. Payment-card details are handled by the selected payment provider; Edu World does not collect card numbers or CVV through its application forms.\n\nWebsite features\nThe site uses necessary session and security cookies. External map, YouTube and WhatsApp links may connect you to third-party services with their own privacy policies.\n\nYour choices\nContact info@eduworld.bh to ask about your information, request correction or deletion, or discuss consent. We will review requests in light of the service provided and any applicable record-keeping obligations. We retain information only for as long as needed for the service and applicable obligations.\n\nContact\nEdu World, Segaya, Manama, Kingdom of Bahrain. Email: info@eduworld.bh. Phone: +973 33640001."],
            'terms' => ['Terms & Conditions', "Our services\nEdu World provides education consultancy, job assistance, visa application assistance, documentation, attestation and related support. The scope, charges, third-party fees and expected process for a particular service will be explained before you proceed.\n\nYour information\nProvide accurate and complete information and authentic documents. Tell us promptly about changes that may affect your application. You remain responsible for reviewing information and documents prepared for submission.\n\nIndependent decisions\nInstitutions make admission decisions. Employers make recruitment decisions. Embassies, consulates and immigration authorities make visa decisions. Edu World does not guarantee admission, employment or visa approval.\n\nThird parties and timelines\nRequirements, appointment availability and processing times depend on the responsible organizations. Any estimated timeline is subject to their procedures and your submission of complete information.\n\nQuestions\nFor clarification of a service agreement, contact info@eduworld.bh before confirming the service or making a payment."],
            'payment-terms' => ['Payment Terms', "Before paying\nConfirm the service, application or invoice reference, amount and fee breakdown with Edu World. Amounts are recorded in Bahraini dinars (BHD) to three decimal places. Service charges and third-party charges should be clarified for your particular application before payment.\n\nOnline payments\nWhere enabled, online payment is processed through an approved external payment provider. Do not send payment-card numbers or CVV by enquiry forms, email or WhatsApp. A payment is confirmed only after verification by the provider or authorized verification of an offline payment. A browser redirect alone is not proof of payment.\n\nPayment records\nKeep your application and transaction references. Contact our team if a debit appears on your account but no confirmation is received; do not repeat the payment until its status has been checked.\n\nService outcomes\nPayment covers the agreed service and does not guarantee admission, employment, a visa or another third-party decision. Please review the Refund & Cancellation Policy and the specific terms supplied for your service."],
            'refund-policy' => ['Refund & Cancellation Policy', "Requesting cancellation\nContact info@eduworld.bh or +973 33640001 as soon as you wish to cancel a service. Include your application or transaction reference, the service requested and the reason for cancellation.\n\nReview of requests\nRefund eligibility depends on the terms agreed for your service, the work already completed, charges already paid to third parties and any applicable requirements. Ask for the service-specific cancellation terms before paying. This page does not promise that every payment is refundable or exclude rights that apply to you.\n\nThird-party charges\nInstitutions, authorities, insurers, reservation providers and payment providers may apply their own rules and charges. Edu World will explain relevant known charges for the requested service.\n\nIncorrect or duplicate payment\nReport a suspected duplicate or incorrect payment promptly with the transaction references. Our team will verify the records and explain the next steps.\n\nApproved refunds\nIf a refund is approved, our team will confirm the amount, method and expected processing period. Timing may also depend on the payment provider or bank."],
            'disclaimer' => ['Service Disclaimer', "Edu World provides education consultancy, job assistance, visa application assistance, documentation and related support services.\n\nAdmission decisions are made by the respective educational institutions. Employment is subject to employer selection, eligibility and applicable labour and immigration requirements. Visa decisions are made exclusively by the relevant embassy, consulate or immigration authority.\n\nEdu World does not guarantee admission, employment or visa approval. Job availability depends on confirmed employer requirements. Registering a candidate profile is not an offer of employment.\n\nInformation on this website provides general service guidance. Requirements and procedures can vary by country, institution, employer and individual circumstances. Confirm the current requirements for your own application with the relevant organization and discuss your case with our team.\n\nPhotos and general guidance articles illustrate our services and are not evidence of a particular partnership, placement, vacancy or successful outcome."],
        ];
        foreach ($pages as $slug => [$title, $body]) {
            $templateBody = strtr($body, ['Edu World' => '[[company_name]]', 'info@eduworld.bh' => '[[email]]', '+973 33640001' => '[[phone]]', 'Segaya, Manama, Kingdom of Bahrain' => '[[address]]']);
            $page = Page::firstOrCreate(['slug' => $slug], ['title' => $title, 'body' => $templateBody, 'seo_title' => $title.' | Edu World Bahrain', 'review_required' => true]);
            if (! $page->wasRecentlyCreated && $page->review_required && $page->body === $body) {
                $page->update(['body' => $templateBody]);
            }
        }
    }
}
